---
/**
 * The product page's ONE client script (ADR-0039, which amends ADR-0012's fence
 * and ADR-0034's "last exception"): a fresh idempotency key per add-to-cart
 * SUBMISSION, so a second press adds a second unit instead of replaying the
 * first (issue #37). An EXTERNAL, first-party file
 * (`public/scripts/add-to-cart-key.js`) — no inline code, no framework — and
 * pure progressive enhancement: without it the form posts the key the server
 * rendered, which is the no-JS behaviour ADR-0039 records.
 *
 * Script only, no markup, rendered by the PAGE (`products/[slug].astro`) and
 * never by a theme view — a view is reached from every page through the theme
 * registry. `checkout-client-js.test.ts` names exactly this pair.
 */
---

<script is:inline type="module" src="/scripts/add-to-cart-key.js"></script>
